  "update_count": 43,
  "description_snippet": "The HTML5 spec states, as part of the algorithm for window.history.replaceState:\r\n\r\nCompare the resulting absolute URL to the document's address. If any part of these two URLs differ other than the <path>, <query>, and <fragment> components, then raise a SECURITY_ERR exception and abort these steps."
}